+# Shared drill configuration template — CHG-058
+
+Approved by direct owner instruction on2026-10-23: use the sequence drill configuration template for single-trigger drill configuration pages and reuse the template. The existing common trigger configuration owner serves Single, Repeated, Par time and Trigger control; all four use the shared layout.
